{
  "id": "PSA.42",
  "number": "42",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 42",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, Maschil, for the sons of Korah.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the hart panteth after the water brooks, so panteth my soul after thee, O God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My soul thirsteth for God, for the living God: when shall I come and appear before God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My tears have been my meat day and night, while they continually say unto me, Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I remember these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I pour out my soul in me: for I had gone with the multitude, I went with them to the house of God, with the voice of joy and praise, with a multitude that kept holyday.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why art thou cast down, O my soul? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "why",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "art thou disquieted in me? hope thou in God: for I shall yet praise him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the help of his countenance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O my God, my soul is cast down within me: therefore will I remember thee from the land of Jordan, and of the Hermonites, from the hill Mizar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deep calleth unto deep at the noise of thy waterspouts: all thy waves and thy billows are gone over me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will command his lovingkindness in the daytime, and in the night his song",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my prayer unto the God of my life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will say unto God my rock, Why hast thou forgotten me? why go I mourning because of the oppression of the enemy?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with a sword in my bones, mine enemies reproach me; while they say daily unto me, Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why art thou cast down, O my soul? and why art thou disquieted within me? hope thou in God: for I shall yet praise him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "who is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.42.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.42.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the health of my countenance, and my God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.43",
    "number": "43",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.41",
    "number": "41",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  }
}